<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>GrandRP Automatic bunker target finder 1920  x 1080 FHD</Major>
    <Description>This macro automatically tests all persons with a bunker for you, as it is well known that it can be very annoying and time-consuming to search for a bunker to rob yourself. The program runs fully automatically and is very likely to be much faster than if you were to do this manually.

The procedure:
First, the macro goes down the list until the message appears that there are no more bunkers. As soon as this message is received, the program jumps into pass-through mode and scrolls and presses the buttons automatically. Note that the time delays should not really be reduced, otherwise there is a risk that most of the bunkers will not be tested at all.

Requirements:
You must be in the bunker menu. It is not necessary to expand or scroll down the list. 
The macro only works with 1920 x 1080 FHD. Please only use “windows without frames”.
Do not move the mouse when the macro is activated, otherwise there is a risk that up to 5 bunkers will not be tested, as the macro partly also uses mouse position displacement depending on the current position in order to keep the complex macro more compact and clearer.

You can find more very useful macros for GrandRP on my account.

If the macro has problems or you have general suggestions, please write me a message.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
